sequenceDiagram
 actor U as Owner
 participant A as API
 participant D as Store
 participant Q as Queue/worker
 participant P as Live policy
 U->>A: Generate(input revision,idempotency key)
 A->>P: Authorize
 A->>D: Deduplicate key/payload;create operation + snapshots
 A->>Q: Enqueue bounded job
 A-->>U: 202 operation
 Q->>P: Recheck live authorization
 Q->>D: Read pinned inputs/book;persist immutable result
 Q-->>U: Status available through authorized polling
 U->>A: Export/download
 A->>P: Live check
 A-->>U: Authorized structured/export result
